    "detailed_description": "Matachin, is a 2D video game of Metroidvania-type platforms. Strange things are happening in Pasto. People no longer leave their houses or play with Eugenia Chalac\u00e1n, our protagonist, who felt in sadness claws since her grandfather, El\u00edas Chalac\u00e1n, passed away. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn afternoon, Eugenia also known as Cuza, searches through her grandfather's belongings. There, she finds a letter, in which her grandfather tell her that inside the Carnival Museum, she will find the way to destroy sadness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the Museum, she will find the Golden Matach\u00edn, a monkey that will grant Eugenia the powers to enter the Spirit World y getting back to his home, defeat sadness, play with her friends and bring back happiness to her city.",
